    Bug 1958585 - Ensure that the selection is restored after manual folder sorting. r=mkmelin

    #### How to test

    - Select a folder and drag it to reorder it above or below another folder.
    - Ensure the current selection and focus is restored after the folder was reordered.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D244495

